  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-应用、小程序与游戏\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"查询当前客户的快应用信息，可根据应用状态、修改时间、搜索关键字等条件筛选。需通过【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token。返回码和返回信息详见【附录-返回码】。\",\"id\":\"tool.quick_app.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tool/quick_app_management/quick_app/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1758407389420547\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"common.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"common.return_code.reference\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"用于查看返回码和返回信息的具体含义\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"【附录-返回码】\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1758407389420547\",\"title\":\"查询快应用信息\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EsKh7f4q\">查询当前客户的快应用</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201751021726618638%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-hR9hRRON\" id=\"h346b9f0-hR9hRRON\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-b4HW0HYc\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tool/quick_app_management/quick_app/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tool/quick_app_management/quick_app/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1758407389420547\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-4gTSZ6Lg\" id=\"h346b9f0-4gTSZ6Lg\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-nIk2whNB\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-E7hmXJBF\" id=\"h346b9f0-E7hmXJBF\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-tNta7OEX\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-IlbRCSmG\" id=\"h346b9f0-IlbRCSmG\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-4Ln2t7fe\">客户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">status</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JJaadWpD\">应用状态，允许值：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-VJaN38ZW\"><code>AUDIT_DOING</code> 审核中、<code>AUDIT_SEND_REJECTED</code> 送审失败 、<code>AUDIT_REJECTED</code> 审核失败、<code>AUDIT_ACCEPTED</code> 审核成功、<code>REMOVED</code> 已下架</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" styl